---
permalink: /contact/index.html
title: "Contact Sora Labs"
description: "Talk through the job before you write a brief. Tell us where your team loses time to repetitive work and we will tell you whether a purpose-built agent is the right answer."
nav_active: contact
---
{% extends "layouts/site.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<section class="hero center" style="padding-bottom:40px;">
  <div class="orb-field" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="orb orb-sand" style="width:440px;height:440px;top:-150px;left:16%"></span>
    <span class="orb orb-sky"  style="width:400px;height:400px;top:-120px;right:14%"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">Contact</div>
    <h1>Ask us anything</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Where does your team lose hours to work that never changes? Describe it roughly and you get a straight answer on whether an agent is the right tool, and what it would take.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:24px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brief-grid">

      <div class="card card-lg">
        <h2 class="display-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Tell us what you are working on</h2>
        <p class="body-sm" style="margin-bottom:28px;">A few details are enough for a useful, specific reply, usually within one business day. If you already know the agent you want, the <a href="/build/" style="color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline-strong)">brief form</a> gets you a faster answer.</p>
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/mgojplrg" method="POST">
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="business">Company or website</label>
            <input type="text" id="business" name="business" placeholder="Company name or URL">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="type">Industry</label>
            <select id="type" name="industry">
              <option value="">Select one (optional)</option>
              <option>Healthcare / dental</option>
              <option>Construction / trades</option>
              <option>Insurance</option>
              <option>Logistics</option>
              <option>Professional / service firm</option>
              <option>Software / technology</option>
              <option>Retail / hospitality</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="improve">What would you hand to an agent? <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <span class="hint">The repetitive job that eats a person's week. Rough is fine.</span>
            <textarea id="improve" name="message" placeholder="e.g. Our office manager spends two days a month chasing insurance denials, and half of them never get appealed." required></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="hp-company">Company (leave blank)</label>
            <input type="text" id="hp-company" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://sora-labs.net/thanks/">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New inquiry from sora-labs.net">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send message&nbsp;&rarr;</button>
          <p class="form-note">Prefer email? Write us at <a href="mailto:nadia@sora-labs.net">nadia@sora-labs.net</a>. We never share your details.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card card-sticky">
          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Ready to be specific</div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Skip ahead</h3>
          <p class="body-sm" style="margin-bottom:16px;">If you already know the job, describe it directly. Four steps, ten minutes, and a spec comes back.</p>
          <a href="/build/" class="btn-primary" style="width:100%;">Generate an agent&nbsp;&rarr;</a>

          <div style="height:1px;background:var(--hairline);margin:26px 0;"></div>

          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Direct</div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Email us</h3>
          <p class="body-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px;">For anything that does not fit a form.</p>
          <a href="mailto:nadia@sora-labs.net" style="font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline-strong);">nadia@sora-labs.net</a>

          <div style="height:1px;background:var(--hairline);margin:26px 0;"></div>

          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Not ready to talk?</div>
          <h3 class="display-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Get The Briefing</h3>
          <p class="body-sm" style="margin-bottom:14px;">A free weekly read on what AI agents are actually doing inside real businesses.</p>
          <form action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/nclawdev" method="post" class="embeddable-buttondown-form" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;">
            <label for="bd-email">Enter your email</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" id="bd-email" placeholder="you@company.com" required style="min-width:0;width:100%;">
            <input type="submit" value="Subscribe free">
            <p><a href="https://buttondown.com/refer/nclawdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Powered by Buttondown.</a></p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
